<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 0.9 points to 710.2 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 0.9 points to 710.2 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 0.9 points on Wednesday to 710.2 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices rose, with the investment fund index rising the most, up 26.9 points to 994.7.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
